          "question": {
            "text": "The maximum frequency of transmitted radio waves above which the radio waves are no longer reflected back by ionosphere is ______ (<math><br> <mrow><br>  <mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo></mrow><br></math><br> maximum electron density of ionosphere,<math><mi>g</mi></math><br>= acceleration due to gravity)",
