          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "Low frequency audio signal cannot be transmitted as such over long distances. Therefore. to overcome this difficulty, the low frequency audio signal is superposed on a high frequency wave (carrier wave). This process is called modulation.",
            "image": null
