          "question": {
            "text": "A signal of frequency $3 \\mathrm{kHz}$ is amplitude modulated on a carrier wave of frequency\n$2 \\cdot 5 \\mathrm{MHz}$. The upper and lower sideband frequencies in the resultant signal are",
