              "isCorrect": false
            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "Modulation index, <math><mi>μ</mi></math> = <math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is carried by the carrier wave, i.e. there is no original distortion.",
